WEBVTT

47:34.628 --> 47:36.797
The Khaleesi wants
to eat something different tonight.

47:36.922 --> 47:38.924
Kill some rabbits.

47:39.049 --> 47:41.093
There are no rabbits.

47:41.218 --> 47:44.930
Find some ducks, she likes ducks.

47:45.055 --> 47:48.517
Have you seen any ducks, woman?
No rabbits, no ducks.

47:48.642 --> 47:50.978
Do you have eyes in your head?
Do you?

47:51.103 --> 47:53.188
Dog then.
I have seen many dogs.

47:53.313 --> 47:55.649
(SPEAKS ENGLISH)
I don't think she wants to eat dog.

47:59.069 --> 48:01.697
The khaleesi have baby inside her.
